\uc0\u9989  Provides a clear benchmark for campaign performance\
\uc0\u9989  Directly ties ad spend to revenue\
\uc0\u9989  Helps maintain profitability guardrails\
Most eCommerce businesses set strict ROAS targets:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 "We need a minimum 300% ROAS to be profitable"\
